<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/luke-kornet/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/luke-kornet/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Luke Kornet’s Salary at San Antonio?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kornet earns $10.45m in 2026-27, eighth at San Antonio and the second year of a four-year contract. It falls from $11m last season. His published career earnings come to $34.2m across ten seasons. The salary is 5.27% of the club’s $198.28m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Luke Kornet Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Two more seasons follow this one, with $24m of the $40.7m guaranteed. The last is a club option with a June 29, 2028 deadline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Luke Kornet Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $10.45m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Does Luke Kornet’s Contract With the Spurs Include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kornet signed a four-year contract worth $40.7m with San Antonio in 2025 using the mid-level exception, of which $24m is guaranteed. The 2027-28 season carries $2.55m guaranteed until June 2027, and the last is a club option. He would reach free agency in 2029 at 33."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Luke Kornet’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kornet’s net worth is estimated at around $13.68m, taken from his $34.2m in published career earnings. Two of his seasons carry no published figure, so the real total is higher. He played four seasons at Vanderbilt and went undrafted in 2017. New York signed him that summer, at 22."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Luke Kornet Paid $10.45m?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kornet is paid $10.45m because an undrafted player who lasts eight seasons on minimum deals eventually earns a mid-level contract from a club with one to spend. He has signed ten contracts across six clubs."}}]}</script>
